abstract: >-
  A Rust library of fusion and recoupling symbols for symmetric tensors:
  Clebsch-Gordan coefficients and F/R symbols for compact connected Lie groups
  (SU(N), SO(N), Spin(N), Sp(2N), U(N), tori, their products and quotients),
  computed on demand for any admissible labels under a gauge frozen as a
  normative specification, plus abelian, fermion-parity and tabulated
  AnyonWiki fusion categories.
